---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="DAJC Access - DAJC"
  description="DAJC is being developed as a European operational platform and intelligence layer for heavy and oversized transport. Current access and commercial terms will be published when confirmed."
>
  <main class="pricing-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">DAJC access</p>
    <h1>Built for European heavy and oversized transport.</h1>
    <p class="lead">DAJC is under active development. Public tools remain available while Platform and Intelligence capabilities continue to evolve. Current commercial terms will be published here when they are ready.</p>

    <section class="cards" aria-label="DAJC access options">
      <article>
        <p class="tier">Public DAJC.eu</p>
        <h2>Open resources</h2>
        <p>Explore public operational information, DAJC news, the Driving Bans Calendar, demo and Integration Ecosystem.</p>
        <a href="/driving-bans">Open public tools</a>
      </article>
      <article class="featured">
        <p class="tier">DAJC Platform</p>
        <h2>In development</h2>
        <p>The connected workflow for European heavy and oversized transport is being developed and improved continuously.</p>
        <a href="mailto:team@dajc.eu?subject=DAJC%20Platform%20Interest">Contact DAJC</a>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="tier">DAJC Intelligence</p>
        <h2>In development</h2>
        <p>An operational intelligence layer is being developed alongside DAJC's public information resources.</p>
        <a href="/intelligence">Explore Intelligence</a>
      </article>
      <article>
        <p class="tier">Data &amp; integrations</p>
        <h2>Contact DAJC</h2>
        <p>Integration and data access are evaluated individually according to technical fit, permissions and source rights.</p>
        <a href="/partners">Integration Ecosystem</a>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="guardrail">
      <h2>Commercial terms are not announced yet</h2>
      <p>DAJC is evolving during development. We intentionally do not publish provisional prices, detailed future functionality or delivery dates as commitments. Confirmed terms will be published on DAJC.eu when appropriate.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .pricing-page{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:8vh 1.5rem 9vh;text-align:center}.eyebrow{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dajc-orange);margin:0 0 1rem}h1{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.3rem);line-height:1.05;margin:0 auto 1rem;max-width:18ch}.lead{max-width:65ch;margin:0 auto 3rem;color:var(--dajc-muted);font-size:17px;line-height:1.7}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:1rem;text-align:left}.cards article{padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid var(--dajc-line);border-radius:14px;background:rgba(0,38,92,.16)}.cards article.featured{border-color:var(--dajc-orange)}.tier{margin:0 0 .5rem;color:var(--dajc-orange);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase}.cards h2{margin:0 0 .8rem;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif}.cards p{color:var(--dajc-muted);line-height:1.65}.cards a{display:inline-flex;min-height:42px;align-items:center;margin-top:.5rem;padding:0 .85rem;border:1px solid var(--dajc-orange);border-radius:8px;color:var(--dajc-orange);text-decoration:none;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}.featured a{background:var(--dajc-orange);color:var(--dajc-dark)}.guardrail{margin-top:3rem;padding:1.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--dajc-line)}.guardrail h2{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif}.guardrail p{max-width:65ch;margin:0 auto;color:var(--dajc-muted);line-height:1.7}@media(max-width:680px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pricing-page{padding-left:1rem;padding-right:1rem}}
</style>
